This issue comes from putting the disable_preprocessor line before the shader_type definition. Re-ordering to:
```
shader_type canvas_item;
#pragma disable_preprocessor

void fragment() {
	COLOR = texture(TEXTURE, UV);
}
```
removes the error. 

We should do two things as a result:
1. Clarify in the [processor docs](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.html) that ``#pragma disable_preprocessor`` has to be below the shader_type definition; and
2. Add an error to the engine if something is above the shader_type definition
